	(text "ILM and ITIMER Pins:\n\nLet:\nI_{LIM} = 2 A\n\nR_{ILM} (Ohm) = 3334 / I_{LIM} (A) = 1667 Ohm\n\nLet: \nt_{ITIMER} = 5 ms\n\nC_{ITIMER} (nF) = t_{ITIMER} (ms) * I_{ITIMER} (uA) / delta V_{ITIMER} (V) = 5.96 nF\n"
